# Google Chat 配置模板

## 基础配置

```json
{
  "name": "google-chat",
  "description": "Google Chat 配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "channel": "googlechat",
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "webhookUrl": "https://chat.googleapis.com/v1/spaces/xxx/messages?key=xxx",
    "botName": "ClawBot"
  },
  "features": [
    "Webhook 发送",
    "群组消息",
    "卡片消息"
  ],
  "setupSteps": [
    "1. 访问 Google Cloud Console",
    "2. 创建 Google Chat API 项目",
    "3. 配置身份验证",
    "4. 创建 Webhook",
    "5. 复制 Webhook URL",
    "6. 配置到 OpenClaw"
  ]
}
```

## 发送消息

### 文本消息

```json
{
  "text": "Hello from ClawBot!"
}
```

### 卡片消息

```json
{
  "cards": [
    {
      "header": {
        "title": "项目更新",
        "subtitle": "ClawBot 通知"
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "widgets": [
            {
              "textParagraph": {
                "text": "✅ 任务已完成"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## 文件位置
`templates/channels/google-chat.json`
